        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You've served for many years as a guide who leads expeditions up Mount Spire. As a result, you are inured to high altitudes and know the mountain like the back of your hand.</p>\n<p>Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to <strong>Strength</strong> or <strong>Constitution</strong>, and one is a free attribute boost.</p>\n<p>You're trained in the Survival skill and the Mountain Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Terrain Expertise] skill feat with mountain terrain.</p>"
